---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Far Fox" description="How lovefarfox.com, its free tools and the Far Fox shop handle your data, and where to find the Far Fox app privacy policy.">
  <nav class="fixed top-0 w-full z-50 backdrop-blur-md bg-fox-bg/80 border-b border-fox-pink/10">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-3 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center min-h-11 gap-2">
        <img src="/brand/foxy-icon-v1.png" alt="Far Fox" class="w-8 h-8" />
        <span class="text-xl font-900 tracking-tight bg-gradient-to-r from-fox-pink to-fox-purple bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          Far Fox
        </span>
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://app.lovefarfox.com"
        class="inline-flex items-center min-h-11 px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-fox-pink-deep to-fox-purple-deep text-white font-700 text-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-fox-pink/25 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        Open App
      </a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="pt-28 pb-24 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-900 tracking-tight mb-8">
        Privacy <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-fox-pink-deep to-fox-purple-deep bg-clip-text text-transparent">Policy</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-fox-text-light text-sm mb-8">Last updated: October 20, 2026</p>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-fox-text-light leading-relaxed">
        <section class="rounded-2xl border border-fox-pink/20 bg-fox-pink/5 p-5">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-800 text-fox-text mb-3">Using the Far Fox app?</h2>
          <p>
            Far Fox is made by <a href="https://primemenagerie.com" class="text-fox-pink-deep hover:underline">Prime Menagerie</a>, the app studio of Blake Parkinson and Amanda Roth.
            How the app handles your account, your shared space, location, notifications and Foxy's AI features is in the
            <a href="https://primemenagerie.com/privacy#far-fox" class="text-fox-pink-deep hover:underline">Prime Menagerie privacy policy</a>.
            This page covers lovefarfox.com: the website, its free tools and the shop.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-800 text-fox-text mb-3">1. Analytics</h2>
          <p>
            We count page views with Vercel Web Analytics and Umami Cloud. Neither uses cookies or personal identifiers, and we strip the part of the address after <code>#</code> before anything is counted. The site keeps campaign tags (such as utm_source) in session storage for the current browser tab so we can tell which campaigns bring people in. Those tags never include names, places, payment details or orders.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-800 text-fox-text mb-3">2. Free tools</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li><strong>Couple quiz:</strong> the name and answers you enter are saved so we can make your shareable profile page. Anyone with the link can see it, and it isn't listed in search engines. Email us to delete it.</li>
            <li><strong>Countdown and couple games:</strong> what you type stays in the link itself, after the <code>#</code>, which browsers don't send to our server.</li>
            <li><strong>Halfway point and city lookups:</strong> place names you type are sent, through our server, to OpenStreetMap's Nominatim service to find them. Your IP address isn't passed along.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-800 text-fox-text mb-3">3. The shop</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li><strong>Checkout:</strong> Snipcart runs the cart and checkout, and collects your name, email, addresses and payment. We never see your card number. Snipcart may use its own cookies or browser storage to keep your cart.</li>
            <li><strong>Printing and shipping:</strong> when you order, we send your name, email, phone number, shipping address and items to Printful or Printify so they can print and ship them.</li>
            <li><strong>Personalized products:</strong> the names, numbers, cities, messages and dates you add are used to draw your design and are sent to the printer with your order. We don't store the designs.</li>
            <li><strong>Digital maps:</strong> Snipcart emails you a download link. If you bought on Etsy, you enter your order number and purchase email, which we check with Etsy and don't keep.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-800 text-fox-text mb-3">4. Other services</h2>
          <p>
            Pages load the Nunito font from Google Fonts, so Google sees your IP address when the font loads. The site is hosted on Vercel, which keeps standard server logs.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-800 text-fox-text mb-3">5. What we don't do</h2>
          <p>
            We don't sell your personal information, show ads, or use advertising trackers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-800 text-fox-text mb-3">6. Your rights</h2>
          <p>
            You can ask for a copy of your data, to correct it, or to delete it, including a quiz profile. Order records are kept by Snipcart, Printful and Printify as they need for payments, shipping and returns.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-800 text-fox-text mb-3">7. Children's privacy</h2>
          <p>
            Far Fox and this site aren't intended for children under 13, and we don't knowingly collect their information.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-800 text-fox-text mb-3">8. Changes and contact</h2>
          <p>
            When the site changes what it collects, we'll update this page and the date at the top. Questions go to
            <a href="mailto:blake@lovefarfox.com" class="text-fox-pink-deep hover:underline">blake@lovefarfox.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <SiteFooter />
</Layout>
